  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of plane containing line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
